<Layout title="Financials & transparency"><PageIntro eyebrow="Built on trust" title="Clarity is part of the work." description="Explore the public records behind the foundation and understand how our historical impact claims are presented." /><section class="section container article-grid"><div class="prose"><h2>Our nonprofit identity.</h2><p>Abundant Earth Foundation is listed in IRS-derived public records as a 501(c)(3) nonprofit under EIN <strong>36-4631367</strong>. The archived AEF donation page identifies its former name as Humboldt Plan It Green.</p><p>Public records list tax exemption from October 2008; the foundation’s own story dates the AEF launch to 2018. These describe different points in the organization’s history.</p><h2>Annual filings.</h2><p>The figures below are from ProPublica’s IRS-derived Form 990 summaries, reviewed September 18, 2026. Revenue and expenses are organization-level totals, not amounts granted directly to projects.</p><table class="data-table"><caption class="sr-only">Annual revenue and expenses in US dollars, with links to Form 990 filings</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Fiscal year</th><th scope="col">Revenue</th><th scope="col">Expenses</th><th scope="col">Filing</th></tr></thead><tbody>{filings.map(f => <tr><th scope="row">{f.year}</th><td>{f.revenue}</td><td>{f.expenses}</td><td><a href={`https://projects.propublica.org/nonprofits/organizations/364631367/${f.id}/full`} aria-label={`View ${f.year} Form 990, filed ${f.filed}`}>Form 990 ↗</a></td></tr>)}</tbody></table><p class="source-note"><a href="https://projects.propublica.org/nonprofits/organizations/364631367">View all available years and the latest records at ProPublica ↗</a></p><h2>Transparency recognition.</h2><p>The archived Financials page states that AEF received a Candid Silver Seal of Transparency in <strong>2023</strong>. This is historical recognition, not a claim of a current rating.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.guidestar.org/profile/36-4631367">Visit the Candid profile <Icon name="external" /></a><h2>How we describe impact.</h2><p>Our reporting distinguishes AEF’s support, partner-network outcomes, and the intended use of awards. Sources and dates appear alongside project results.</p><a class="text-link" href="/impact/#reporting">Read our reporting approach <Icon /></a></div><aside class="aside-card"><p class="eyebrow">Have a question?</p><h3>Let’s make it clear.</h3><p>For questions about giving, financial records, or fiscal sponsorship, contact the foundation directly.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/?topic=Financial%20records">Ask about the records <Icon /></a></aside></section></Layout>
